.DS_Store

# Local planning workspace - scratch artifacts stay local.
# Exceptions: the 72 worksheet build specs and the worksheet map are tracked,
# because the cloud agents that build worksheets read them from the repo.
# Everything else under docs/ (candidates*.json, clusters*.json, heading-index.*,
# _section-*.md, *.tsv, generator scripts, __pycache__) remains ignored.
docs/*
!docs/worksheets/
!docs/worksheet-map.md
docs/worksheets/**/__pycache__/
